---

This project modifies the Windows registry. It deletes the registry keys that
register third-party Explorer context-menu entries, and exports a backup of each
key before doing so. Registry edits carry inherent risk: review the script and
the backup output before running it, and test on a non-critical machine first.
The authors take no responsibility for any damage resulting from its use.
